      "For 8:30am, pick 8am above and 30 past the hour here.": {"es":"Para las 8:30, elige 8:00 arriba y 30 minutos aquí.","es-MX":"Para las 8:30 a. m., elige 8 a. m. arriba y 30 minutos aquí.","it":"Per le 8:30, scegli 8:00 sopra e 30 minuti qui.","de":"Für 8:30 Uhr wähle oben 8 Uhr und hier 30 Minuten.","fr":"Pour 8 h 30, choisissez 8 h plus haut et 30 minutes ici.","tr":"08:30 için yukarıda 08:00, burada 30 dakika seç.","sr-Latn-RS":"Za 8:30 izaberite 8:00 gore i 30 minuta ovde.","pl":"Dla 8:30 wybierz wyżej 8:00, a tutaj 30 minut.","nl":"Voor 8.30 uur kies je hierboven 8 uur en hier 30 minuten.","cs":"Pro 8:30 vyberte nahoře 8:00 a tady 30 minut.","he":"עבור 8:30, בוחרים 8:00 למעלה, וכאן 30 דקות.","ar":"للساعة 8:30 ص، اختر 8 ص في الأعلى و30 دقيقة هنا.","pt":"Para 8h30, escolha 8h acima e 30 minutos aqui.","ro":"Pentru 8:30, alege 8:00 mai sus și 30 de minute aici.","zh-CN":"要设上午8:30，在上面选“上午8点”，在这里选“30分”。"},
